1
00:00:00,114 --> 00:00:03,148
This guy tried to buy a fighter jet… with Pepsi!

2
00:00:03,148 --> 00:00:04,878
And he actually had the money.

3
00:00:04,878 --> 00:00:09,078
A Pepsi ad offered a Harrier jet… for 7,000,000 Pepsi Points.

4
00:00:09,078 --> 00:00:13,193
It was a joke. But the rules said you could buy points… 10¢ each.

5
00:00:13,193 --> 00:00:18,052
That's $700,000… for a jet worth over $30 million!

6
00:00:18,052 --> 00:00:21,817
So he found investors… and mailed Pepsi a real check.

7
00:00:21,817 --> 00:00:24,417
Pepsi said no. So he sued them!

8
00:00:24,417 --> 00:00:28,948
The judge said no reasonable person would think Pepsi was giving away a fighter jet.

9
00:00:28,948 --> 00:00:33,618
So Pepsi changed the ad. 700,000,000 points… just kidding.
